name "sec:results"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Recall that our primary objective is to assess the performance of the modern approach to poverty mapping by using the Mexican Intercensal Survey as a ground truth.
 To this end,
 panel (a) in Figure 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:mse_targeting"
