 random forest and Bayesian additive regression trees) and the leading parametric alternative (i.e.,
 the area-level model).
\begin_inset Foot
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
In terms of non-parametric models,
 both random forests and Bayesian additive regression trees are quite popular and have been shown to perform comparably to,
